---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_NAME, AUTHOR } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description="How the Moving to Ireland app and website handle personal information: what is collected, by which services, and how to contact us."
>
  <div class="hero-band px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px]">
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(24px,4.4vw,34px)]">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-white/85">Last updated 13 September 2026 · effective from 20 February 2023</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 pt-9 sm:px-6">
    <p>
      {AUTHOR} built the Moving to Ireland app as a freemium app and publishes this
      website. This page explains what information the app and the website collect,
      how it is used, and who it is shared with. By using either, you agree to the
      collection and use of information as described here.
    </p>

    <h2>The website</h2>
    <p>
      This is a static site. It has no accounts, logins, comments or forms, and it
      does not set cookies of its own. When you tap through to the App Store, Apple
      handles that visit under its own privacy policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Information the app collects</h2>
    <p>
      To tailor the checklist, the app asks for a few details about your move —
      such as your country of citizenship, whether you have already arrived, and
      whether you are moving with a partner, children or pets. This information is
      stored on your device and is not sent to us.
    </p>
    <p>
      The app uses third-party services that may collect information used to
      identify you. Their privacy policies are here:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://firebase.google.com/policies/analytics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics for Firebase</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Firebase Crashlytics</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://mixpanel.com/legal/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mixpanel</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://amplitude.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amplitude</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RevenueCat</a> (subscription management)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Log data</h2>
    <p>
      If the app crashes or errors, these services collect log data from your
      phone: its IP address, device name, operating system version, the app's
      configuration at the time, the date and time, and similar statistics.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The app does not use cookies explicitly, but the third-party code it includes
      may use cookies or similar identifiers to improve its services. You can refuse
      them, though some parts of the app may then not work.
    </p>

    <h2>Service providers</h2>
    <p>
      We employ third-party companies to facilitate the app, provide it on our
      behalf, perform related services, or help us analyse how it is used. They have
      access to your personal information only to perform those tasks and are
      obliged not to disclose or use it for any other purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use commercially acceptable means to protect your personal information,
      but no method of transmission over the internet or of electronic storage is
      completely secure, and we cannot guarantee its absolute security.
    </p>

    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>
      The guides link to official Irish sources and other external sites. We do not
      operate those sites and are not responsible for their content or privacy
      practices; review their policies before sharing information with them.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The app and website are not addressed to anyone under 13, and we do not
      knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe
      a child has provided us with personal information, contact us and we will
      delete it.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. Changes are posted on this page
      with a new "last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
